{#- The call at the bottom of a page (Tine, file 62, October 2026, option A): a photo as a band edge to edge under GoodPlanet's dark blue, a big title, one line and a big
    lime button, everywhere this block stood. The photo only sets the mood (alt=""); the band ends in the footer's wave.
    An exchange can set its own "cta" in its front matter (title, text, label, url): same band, its own words.
    The title, button and last line of the usual call are in src/_data/joinCall.json ("Join call" in the browser editor).
    Styles: "Inner pages" in site.css, under .exchange-cta.
    The photo: about twenty of us cheering by a canal in Ghent, 2022 (Tine, file 70, option A). Before it: the Senate
    plenary of 2015 (far more people than a group has), the kayak paddles (did not speak to the imagination) and the
    Zeeland group with arms wide (nearly square, so the wide band cut off too much), all 5 October 2026. -#}
{%- set call = joinCall | localize(L) %}{% set why = whyJoin | localize(L) %}
<section class="exchange-cta on-dark">
  {% photo "ghent-2022-canal-cheering", "", { sizes: "100vw", class: "exchange-cta-photo" } %}
  <div class="container">
    <h2>{{ cta.title if cta else call.title }}</h2>
    {#- Right above the button, the four reasons to join once more, short (designer feedback, 5 October 2026: the selling points
        belong by the button; "no fee, travel, bed and meals" stays at the top of the homepage, on Join and on the four
        exchange pages, under Cost). The same points and icons as the band at the top of the homepage (src/_data/whyJoin.json). -#}
    {% if cta %}<p>{{ cta.text }}</p>{% else %}
    <ul class="cta-why" role="list" aria-label="{{ T.whyJoin }}">
      {% for w in why.items %}<li><span class="icon-disc tone-{{ ['lime', 'orange', 'pink', 'green'][loop.index0 % 4] }}">{% lineIcon w.icon %}</span>{{ w.title }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endif %}
    <a class="btn btn-tint-lime" href="{{ cta.url if cta else ('/join/' | localUrl(L)) }}"{% if not cta %} data-goatcounter-click="join-cta" data-goatcounter-title="Join us (bottom of page)" data-goatcounter-referrer="{{ page.url }}"{% endif %}>{{ cta.label if cta else call.button }}</a>
    {% if not cta and call.who %}<p class="cta-who">{{ call.who }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
